  "question": {
    "text": "Give the decreasing order of reactivity of the following compounds with HBr.<br />\r(I) <img src=\"assets\\qt0052_e05d8df2f216.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.35in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(II) <img src=\"assets\\qt0052_ba30b8b238f1.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.95833in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(III) <img src=\"assets\\qt0052_090b62446125.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.99167in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(IV) <img src=\"assets\\qt0052_5fc862639395.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.80833in;height:0.775in\" />"
  },
  "options": [
