  "solution": {
    "text": "Electron Releasing Group favours <math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>S</mtext>   <mtext>N</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>1</mtext></mrow></math> reactivity with <math> <mtext>HBr</mtext></math>. <math> <mtext>EWG</mtext></math> retards <math> <msub>  <mtext>S</mtext>  <mtext>N</mtext> </msub> <mtext>1</mtext></math> reactivity with <math> <mtext>HBr</mtext></math>.<br /><math> <mtext>ERG</mtext></math> effect of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is greater than <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>)</mo></math> group <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> So, reactivity of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br />In <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> group is at m-position and exerts only <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> effect and so reactivity of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is less than <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />So the reactivity order is: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
  }
